abstract: >-
  Boundary-aware adaptation of two frozen foundation models (SAM 2.1 Hiera-L
  and DINOv2 ViT-L/14) for four-class rooftop material segmentation at 0.14 m
  ground sampling distance, with 6.97 M trainable parameters (1.33% of 523.1 M).
keywords:
  - rooftop segmentation
  - boundary-aware segmentation
  - foundation model adaptation
  - SAM2
  - DINOv2
  - parameter-efficient learning
references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
      Boundary Fidelity in Frozen Foundation-Model Adaptation: When It Holds
      and When It Fails for Fine-Grained Rooftop Segmentation
